## Floor

Accuracy is a floor: on Herald's publishing paths (ship, auto publish) no body that has not passed verify is published, including human-edited bodies.

The floor is not traded against anything below. It covers Herald's publishing paths only; deploys run outside Herald are a residual risk, not a loophole.

## Priority above the floor

Priority above the floor: search visibility > reader value

When two roles disagree, the editor-in-chief rules in this order. This priority order is not an evolve target: `/hrd evolve` never proposes changing it; only a human edits it.

## Purpose

- Promoted service: {{PROMOTED_SERVICE}}
- Call to action: {{CTA}}
- North star metric: {{NORTH_STAR}}

Search visibility is the means; the north star is the goal. Articles serve readers who might need {{PROMOTED_SERVICE}} — they are not doorway pages for it.
